+XTRACE -- Opposing Force X, BUILD.md section 28. Not upstream.
+Was: #if defined(_WIN32) && !XASH_XBOX
+
+DLLEXPORT is used in exactly one place in this engine -- sv_game.c:40, the
+GIVEFNPTRSTODLL typedef. Excluding the Xbox from __stdcall made the engine call
+GiveFnptrsToDll as cdecl, but the game dll comes from hlsdk built with its own
+headers, where dlls/h_export.cpp:47 defines EXPORT2 as WINAPI. The symbol says
