+and the caller with 'addl $8, %esp'. ESP came back 8 too high; SV_LoadProgs has
+no frame pointer, so the skew rode all the way to its 'retl', which then popped
+garbage. Everything before that worked because the function keeps almost
+nothing on the stack. See BUILD.md 28.2.
+*/
+#if defined(_WIN32)
